qwarp (0.10.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add trusted executable path validation (SEC-01).
  * Add atomic single-instance ownership and IPC boundaries (SEC-02, SEC-04).
  * Refine toggle appearance, status typography, and layout stability.
  * Bound subprocess execution and sanitize diagnostics logs (ROB-01, PRIV-04, PERF-02).

 -- Ashutosh Tiwari <contact@ashutoshtiwari.dev>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

